<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Share, above the conference, mints a link to the call you are in and puts the address in a field you can copy. Pasting it into a channel or a private message draws a card instead of a bare address — any such link becomes a card, including one somebody sent you from outside."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_ban}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "What a link does not do")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "A link says which room it is; it never says you may be in it. Whoever follows it still has to be registered with NickServ and a member of the channel, and a locked conference still refuses everyone but its moderators. Only a registered nickname can mint one, because the link records who made it."
  )}
</p>

<p>
  {dgettext("help_p2p", "See also:")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-channel-conference">
    {dgettext("help_p2p", "Channel Conference")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-conference-tab">
    {dgettext("help_p2p", "Conference in Its Own Tab")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
